      "text": "uname -a                 # kernel + architecture\ncat /etc/os-release      # which distribution\nwhoami                   # who am I logged in as\nssh user@server-ip       # connect to a remote box\nwsl --install -d Ubuntu  # (Windows) get Linux locally",
