      "width": 775.76,
      "height": 237.6,
      "text": "pwd                 # where am I\nls -lah             # list: long + hidden + sizes\ncd /var/log         # move around   (cd - = go back)\nmkdir -p a/b/c      # create nested folders\ncp / mv / rm        # copy / move / remove\nfind / -name '*.log'  # find files anywhere",
