      "text": "cat / less / head / tail   # view a file\ntail -f app.log            # follow logs live\nnano file        # easy editor  (vim: i  Esc  :wq)\ngrep -rin 'error' /var/log # search inside files\ncmd | grep x     # pipe: output \u2192 next input\ncmd > file  /  >> file     # write / append",
